### ============================================================================
### TOOGLE MASTER - API & OBSERVABILITY REQUESTS (FASE 4)
### ============================================================================
### Este arquivo pode ser usado com a extensão "REST Client" no VS Code
### ou no WebStorm para testar as APIs, Métricas, Tracing e Chaos localmente.
### ============================================================================

@auth_host = http://localhost:8001
@flag_host = http://localhost:8002
@targeting_host = http://localhost:8003
@evaluation_host = http://localhost:8004
@analytics_host = http://localhost:8005

@otel_health_host = http://localhost:13133
@otel_metrics_host = http://localhost:8889
@prometheus_host = http://localhost:9090
@loki_host = http://localhost:3100
@grafana_host = http://localhost:3000

# Chave mestra e chave de API padrão já pré-cadastrada no seed (init.sql)
@master_key = sua_chave_mestra_aqui
@api_key = tm_key_f54b81bc161a5b84c277ed954384ae950c87adb8c795892db4abfaef75aaacab

### ============================================================================
### 1. AUTH SERVICE (Porta 8001)
### ============================================================================

### 1.1. Health Check
GET {{auth_host}}/health

### 1.2. Criar nova chave de API (Requer MASTER_KEY)
# @name createKey
POST {{auth_host}}/admin/keys
Authorization: Bearer {{master_key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Chave do Flag Service"
}

### 1.3. Validar chave de API (Padrão do Seed)
GET {{auth_host}}/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{api_key}}

### 1.4. Métricas Prometheus do Auth Service
GET {{auth_host}}/metrics


### ============================================================================
### 2. FLAG SERVICE (Porta 8002)
### ============================================================================

### 2.1. Health Check
GET {{flag_host}}/health

### 2.2. Criar uma nova Flag (new_checkout_flow)
POST {{flag_host}}/flags
Authorization: Bearer {{api_key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "new_checkout_flow",
    "description": "Ativa o novo fluxo de checkout",
    "is_enabled": true
}

### 2.3. Listar todas as Flags
GET {{flag_host}}/flags
Authorization: Bearer {{api_key}}

### 2.4. Buscar uma Flag específica
GET {{flag_host}}/flags/new_checkout_flow
Authorization: Bearer {{api_key}}

### 2.5. Métricas Prometheus do Flag Service
GET {{flag_host}}/metrics


### ============================================================================
### 3. TARGETING SERVICE (Porta 8003)
### ============================================================================

### 3.1. Health Check
GET {{targeting_host}}/health

### 3.2. Criar uma regra para a Flag (new_checkout_flow)
POST {{targeting_host}}/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{api_key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "flag_name": "new_checkout_flow",
    "is_enabled": true,
    "rules": {
        "type": "PERCENTAGE",
        "value": 90.0
    }
}

### 3.3. Buscar regra de uma Flag
GET {{targeting_host}}/rules/new_checkout_flow
Authorization: Bearer {{api_key}}

### 3.4. Métricas Prometheus do Targeting Service
GET {{targeting_host}}/metrics


### ============================================================================
### 4. EVALUATION SERVICE (Porta 8004 — Gera Trace Distribuído Ponta a Ponta)
### ============================================================================

### 4.1. Health Check
GET {{evaluation_host}}/health

### 4.2. Avaliar uma Flag para um Usuário (Dispara HTTP -> Flag/Targeting -> Auth e SQS -> Analytics)
GET {{evaluation_host}}/evaluate?flag_name=new_checkout_flow&user_id=user_12345

### 4.3. Métricas Prometheus do Evaluation Service
GET {{evaluation_host}}/metrics


### ============================================================================
### 5. ANALYTICS SERVICE (Porta 8005)
### ============================================================================

### 5.1. Health Check
GET {{analytics_host}}/health

### 5.2. Métricas Prometheus do Analytics Service (Inclui analytics_events_processed_total)
GET {{analytics_host}}/metrics


### ============================================================================
### 6. CHAOS ENGINEERING & PROVA REAL (FASE 4 — Simulação de Incidentes HTTP 500)
### ============================================================================

### 6.1. Consultar status do Chaos Mode no Evaluation Service
GET {{evaluation_host}}/chaos/fail

### 6.2. ATIVAR falha proposital (HTTP 500) no Evaluation Service (Para disparar Alerta > 5%)
POST {{evaluation_host}}/chaos/fail?enable=true

### 6.3. DESATIVAR falha proposital no Evaluation Service (Restaurar operação normal)
POST {{evaluation_host}}/chaos/fail?enable=false

### 6.4. ATIVAR falha proposital (HTTP 500) no Auth Service
POST {{auth_host}}/chaos/fail?enable=true

### 6.5. DESATIVAR falha proposital no Auth Service
POST {{auth_host}}/chaos/fail?enable=false

### 6.6. ATIVAR falha proposital (HTTP 500) no Flag Service
POST {{flag_host}}/chaos/fail?enable=true

### 6.7. DESATIVAR falha proposital no Flag Service
POST {{flag_host}}/chaos/fail?enable=false


### ============================================================================
### 7. OBSERVABILITY STACK (OTel Collector, Prometheus, Loki & Grafana)
### ============================================================================

### 7.1. OpenTelemetry Collector Health Check
GET {{otel_health_host}}/

### 7.2. OpenTelemetry Collector Prometheus Exporter Metrics
GET {{otel_metrics_host}}/metrics

### 7.3. Prometheus Targets Status
GET {{prometheus_host}}/api/v1/targets

### 7.4. Loki Ready Check
GET {{loki_host}}/ready

### 7.5. Loki Labels Disponíveis
GET {{loki_host}}/loki/api/v1/labels

### 7.6. Grafana Health Check
GET {{grafana_host}}/api/health
